A heading's closing `#` run is dropped when a space precedes it (`# Title #`, `## Closed heading ##`, `## ##`) and kept otherwise (`Trailing hashes###`); a `#` inside the text, as in `C#`, stays.
== args
input/doc.md
== file input/doc.md
# Title #
## Closed heading ##
### C# is kept
#### Trailing hashes###
## ##
== stdout
input/doc.md (5 lines)
[L1-L5] # Title
[L2-L4] ## Closed heading
[L3-L4] ### C# is kept
[L4-L4] #### Trailing hashes###
[L5-L5] ##
== stderr
== exit 0
